{"sections":[{"slug":"同伦类型论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"同伦类型论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦类型论</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">学科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"同伦类型论"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"学科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">同伦类型论是一门新的提供</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学基础","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">数学基础</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">尤其是与同伦论</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/无穷范畴.md.","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">有关的数学基础</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的语言</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其自带的推理系统以及对类型</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">特别是等式类型</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">解读使得它比经典逻辑下的集合论更接近于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象的内语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">更能贴合同伦论的实践</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/综合同伦论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">综合同伦论</span>"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">同伦类型论的诞生与</span> Voevodsky <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/UF","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">泛等基础</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">计划有深刻的联系</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}